#### Variation 1: Multiple Scenario Outlines in One Feature

When a feature has multiple behavioral requirements, each gets its own `Scenario Outline` with its own set of jurisdiction-tagged `Examples`:

```gherkin
@empi
Feature: Feed identity

  Rule: New identity creates a person record

    @FR-EMPI-FD-010
    Scenario Outline: First-time feed creates person
      ...
      @generic
      Examples: ...
      @kansas
      Examples: ...

  Rule: Duplicate identity merges into existing person

    @FR-EMPI-FD-020
    Scenario Outline: Duplicate feed merges person
      ...
      @generic
      Examples: ...
      @kansas
      Examples: ...
```

